{
    return Inertia::render('Task/Index', [
        'tasks' => $query->paginate(15), // Query sudah terfilter!
    ]);
}
```

### 2. Scope Delegation
Filter kompleks di-delegasikan ke Model Scope via `AllowedFilter::scope()`:

```php
